{"step_index":1143,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-21T16:46:03Z","content":"We have built and deployed a dedicated, high-resolution **Interactive Zoomable Report Card Inspector** ([`ZoomableImageModal.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/components/ZoomableImageModal.tsx)).\n\n---\n\n### 🔍 Interactive Zoom & Pan Controls\n\n1. **Floating Zoom Buttons (`+` / `-` / `1x Reset`):**\n   - Quick-zoom buttons in the header allow step-by-step magnification from **100% up to 400%**.\n   - Tap the percentage badge (`100%`) anytime to instantly reset the view to fit the screen.\n\n2. **Touch & Pinch-to-Zoom:**\n   - Supports natural two-finger pinch-to-zoom on mobile and touch devices.\n   - Smooth 2-way panning (horizontal + vertical scroll) lets you glide across any section of the card to read fine handwriting, teacher signatures, and written questions.\n\n3. **Integrated Across All Views:**\n   - **Master Pipeline ([`ListsScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/ListsScreen.tsx)):** Tap **\"Card\"** on any educator card.\n   - **Power Dialer Cockpit ([`DialerHudScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx)):** Tap **\"View Original Report Card\"** during or between calls.\n   - **Educator Detail Profile ([`LeadDetailScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/LeadDetailScreen.tsx)):** Tap **\"View Original Report Card\"**.\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 Production Deployment Live\nThe updated build has been compiled and published live:\n👉 **[https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh](https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh)**"}
